DESCRIPTION:Palo Alto\nhttps://ma.to/event/meyhouse-prix-fixe-lunch-2026-1
 0-12\n\nMeyhouse in Downtown Palo Alto serves lunch Monday through Friday
 \, with a $44.95 three-course prix fixe alongside the regular lunch menu.
  The Meyhane-style small plates are made for sharing family style\, with 
 options such as mesquite fire-grilled octopus\, lemon cured branzino and 
 Antep-style marinated tenderloin. Wine\, non-alcoholic cocktails\, baklav
 a and ice cream are also available during lunch.
